{"id":"18.12.TapCircle.air","contentHtml":"<p>This <strong>fully independent project</strong> was brought by me from the original idea to a release-ready mobile game.</p>\n<blockquote>\n<p>As a <strong>Solo Developer</strong>, I was responsible for <strong>100%</strong> of all aspects: game design, programming, shaders, UI, and service integration.</p>\n</blockquote>\n<hr>\n<h2>Challenge</h2>\n<p>The key task was to <strong>go through the full cycle of creating a release-ready mobile arcade alone</strong>, including developing unique core mechanics, meta-game, and the entire visual style.</p>\n<hr>\n<h2>Engineering Solution</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>Core Mechanics:</strong> Implemented gameplay where the player <strong>\"magnetizes\"</strong> to hoops and moves along their contour, and on click — detaches and <strong>flies away from the hoop center</strong>.</li>\n<li><strong>Procedural Fill Shader:</strong> Visual feedback is implemented via a custom shader (<code>Shader Forge</code>) that <strong>\"fills\"</strong> the hoop with a <strong>pattern</strong> in real-time as the player moves.</li>\n<li><strong>Flexible Art Pipeline:</strong> Assets were prepared using <strong>masking by RGB channels</strong>, which allowed the shader to flexibly customize them.</li>\n<li><strong>Full-fledged Meta-Game:</strong> Integrated all key elements of an F2P product: in-game currency, <strong>store with color palettes for the whole game</strong>, save system, <strong>in-app purchases</strong>, and <strong>leaderboards</strong>.</li>\n</ul>\n<hr>\n<h2>Outcome</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>Completed Product Created:</strong> The project was successfully brought from concept to a <strong>fully playable, ready-to-publish game</strong>.</li>\n<li><strong>Demonstration of Product Thinking:</strong> The case proves the ability to <strong>think as a holistic product</strong>, including meta-game, monetization, and social functions.</li>\n<li><strong>Early Expertise in Shaders:</strong> The project demonstrates my early mastery of shader creation tools and the ability to integrate them as a <strong>key gameplay element</strong>.</li>\n</ul>\n","published":true,"title":"Tap Circle.air","date":"2018-12","type":"project","tagsArray":["Mobile","Arcade","Unity","C#","Photoshop","HLSL","Unity Purchasing","Google Play Games","Shader Forge"],"heroVideo":["9I17KV6BehY"],"shortDescription":"<p><strong>Fully solo game</strong> brought to a release-ready state, featuring unique mechanics and a procedural shader.</p>\n","role":"solo","storeLinks":["16.09.Realoft","https://apkpure.com/tapcircle-air-unreleased/com.Realoft.TapCircleAIR"],"projectIcon":"/images/projects/18.12.TapCircle.air/icon.webp","cardBackground":"/images/projects/18.12.TapCircle.air/card.video?v=1765111525384&webm=1&mp4=1","screenshots":[{"src":"/images/projects/18.12.TapCircle.air/screenshots/1.webp","width":528,"height":944},{"src":"/images/projects/18.12.TapCircle.air/screenshots/2.webp","width":528,"height":944},{"src":"/images/projects/18.12.TapCircle.air/screenshots/3.webp","width":528,"height":944},{"src":"/images/projects/18.12.TapCircle.air/screenshots/4.webp","width":528,"height":944},{"src":"/images/projects/18.12.TapCircle.air/screenshots/5.webp","width":528,"height":944}]}